# screenshots from `pnpm check:visual` — never committed
.visual-check/

# Planning and working-process notes — kept local, never published.
# The product specifications in docs/ that a contributor needs stay tracked;
# these describe how the work is run, not what the site is.
/CLAUDE.md
/docs/WORKPLAN.md
/docs/HISTORY.md
/docs/archive/

# Cross-project engineering reference, kept local like the process docs above.
# Not about this site: it documents the X API itself.
/docs/X-API.md

# Paid API data and research working files. NOT a cache - see research/README.md.
# Raw third-party dumps holding hundreds of public profiles; the verified records go to data/.
# research/README.md itself is the one tracked file in this directory - a file inside an ignored
# directory cannot be re-included, so the rule below is /research/* + a negated exception rather
# than the single /research/ line this used to be.
/research/*
!/research/README.md

# Design direction images supplied at the start: LayoffHedge's own branded graphics.
# Kept on disk as reference, never redistributed from this repository.
/references/
